MARKET-DENIAL HEAD — OUR ORIGINAL WORK
  The 13-parameter additive selling policy in main.py (_W / _BIAS) was trained by us
  with evolution strategies. It only APPENDS extra non-wheat SELL orders into leftover
  market slots and never removes or reorders a backbone order.

